<h3>Catechist's Prayer</h3>

<blockquote>
<p>Lord Jesus,<br />
you who being God became man,<br />
who emptied your glory to find me,<br />
teach me to speak of you with the truth of the Creed<br />
but also with the fire of love.<br />
May those who listen not remain only in ideas,<br />
but encounter you, living Lord,<br />
true God and true man,<br />
only Savior of the world.<br />
Amen.</p>
</blockquote>

